1
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:18,420
Aiming for the setting sun
floating over the Nakagawa River,

2
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:23,580
I kicked a pebble and let
it fly until it was gone.

3
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:29,420
Chatting away to the head of the P.E. class,

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,820
they laughed at me for staying
as full of energy as ever.

5
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:37,440
Even if I stir up some
good spirit somewhere,

6
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,680
there's only winning, that's the reason.

7
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,940
One nightmare, the unchanging streetscape,

8
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,880
is gentler than before.

9
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:46,860
Because the crows are cawing,

10
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:48,700
the sun has already set.

11
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,940
Yakitori smoke lingers.

12
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,840
Even just seeing it...

13
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:57,500
Of the acorn cap,

14
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:04,080
the sun sinks from the
waterworks toward the big stone.

15
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:10,100
Tomorrow too,
it'll end the same way, won't it.

16
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:13,660
Katsushika,
for a while I lost my happiness too.

17
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:16,300
Because I've only just come to my senses.

18
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:30,460
I guess it's gonna be a turtle,
then, since it's Kameari Park.

19
00:01:30,460 --> 00:01:33,480
I'm from Katsushika,
so I think a deer would be better.

20
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,380
Still, suddenly being told to come up with
a new character for the Katsushika station...

21
00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:41,060
The chief sure is giving
some ridiculous orders.

22
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:43,820
I have work to do too, you know.

23
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:50,260
Not that it's convincing coming from Ryo-chan,
who's late and slacking off to nap every day.

24
00:01:50,260 --> 00:01:52,400
Quiet! It's done.

25
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:54,280
As expected of you, senpai, you're fast.

26
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:59,120
Well? This is the new mascot for our Katsushika station,
Kumawari-kun!

27
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:06,580
Combining the stiff image of a
police officer with an adorable bear,

28
00:02:06,580 --> 00:02:11,820
and finishing it off as a slightly laid-back, easygoing character.
It's my masterpiece!

29
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:17,580
I'm totally satisfied!
Everyone in town is sure to love it!

30
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:19,580
I really am a genius!

31
00:02:20,420 --> 00:02:21,880
Kumawari-kun

32
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,900
Do you think everyone will like him?

33
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,620
Of course they will!

34
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:30,260
Fight on, Kumawari-kun!

35
00:02:35,140 --> 00:02:38,720
I'm Kumawari-kun!
I'll protect everyone's town, kuma!

36
00:02:39,380 --> 00:02:40,200
Please take a look.

37
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,977
Good morning. He has recently

38
00:02:42,027 --> 00:02:45,340
become the new mascot of the Katsushika police station: Police Officer Kumano,
Kumawari-kun.

39
00:02:45,980 --> 00:02:47,120
Nice to meet you, kuma!

40
00:02:48,580 --> 00:02:49,600
Nice to meet you, kuma!

41
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:50,866
As you can see,

42
00:02:50,916 --> 00:02:54,204
Kumawari-kun enjoys tremendous
popularity even among children.

43
00:02:54,254 --> 00:02:56,220
His future activities
are highly anticipated.

44
00:02:56,580 --> 00:03:00,180
Look! No matter what anyone says,
he's pulling it off pretty well, isn't he?

45
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:04,120
Wow, I had no idea.
He really is that popular

46
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:08,160
That costume must have been hard work.
It's Ryo-chan inside, isn't it?

47
00:03:08,980 --> 00:03:11,516
Yeah, I didn't want to come either,

48
00:03:11,566 --> 00:03:13,200
but there was no one else available.

49
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,640
But I'm never coming back again.

50
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:17,540
The kids clung to me nonstop,

51
00:03:17,590 --> 00:03:20,740
and it was incredibly hot inside the costume.
It was the worst.

52
00:03:20,740 --> 00:03:23,850
That's proof the kids love you, right?

53
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:25,480
You should be happier about it.

54
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:26,376
That's right,

55
00:03:26,426 --> 00:03:29,740
and Katsushika Police Station
is fully backing us up too.

56
00:03:29,740 --> 00:03:33,540
Kumawari-kun's popularity is
going to keep rising and rising.

57
00:03:34,100 --> 00:03:36,425
Wow, Kumawari-kun's height,

58
00:03:36,475 --> 00:03:38,302
weight, favorite food,

59
00:03:38,352 --> 00:03:41,680
signature move, even his friends' names.
You've thought of everything, haven't you?

60
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:44,760
Did you come up with all
of this yourself, senpai?

61
00:03:44,900 --> 00:03:48,200
Of course. I wanted to pursue realism.

62
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:54,060
Besides, kids these days are used to
that kind of setting from games and manga.

63
00:03:54,460 --> 00:03:56,680
I didn't realize that.

64
00:03:56,680 --> 00:04:00,560
Well, when I get serious,
something like this is easy.

65
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:03,920
Though it'd be impossible
for someone like the Chief.

66
00:04:05,220 --> 00:04:06,900
What did I do?

67
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:07,720
Chief.

68
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:10,400
Didn't I tell you to come to
the station chief's office?

69
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:13,260
What do you think your job is?

70
00:04:13,260 --> 00:04:14,260
Sorry.

71
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:17,200
Listen up, everyone.

72
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:18,960
By order of the station chief,

73
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:22,560
I'm taking Kumawari-kun
to a kindergarten now.

74
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,780
A kindergarten?

75
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:28,540
I thought we'd run a traffic
safety campaign with Kumawari-kun.

76
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:29,660
Listen, Ryotsu.

77
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:33,947
Kumawari-kun isn't just the
Katsushika station's mascot,

78
00:04:33,997 --> 00:04:35,940
he's a hero to the children.

79
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:38,940
Whatever you do,
don't shatter the children's dreams.

80
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:42,480
So what, does that mean I'm
wearing the costume again?

81
00:04:42,660 --> 00:04:44,140
No way, I'm not doing that.

82
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:47,720
Idiot! You're Kumawari-kun's creator,
aren't you?

83
00:04:47,940 --> 00:04:49,180
W-what, that's ridiculous.

84
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,360
It's an order. Answer me.

85
00:04:51,820 --> 00:04:52,760
Y-yes, sir.

86
00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:57,280
Wrong. Would Kumawari-kun greet
people with such a slack attitude?

87
00:04:57,280 --> 00:05:01,180
Yes, understood, kuma!
Kumawari-kun is deploying now, kuma!

88
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:03,020
Good.

89
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:05,545
Everyone!

90
00:05:05,595 --> 00:05:09,300
Today, Kumawari-kun has come all the way
from Katsushika Police Station to see you!

91
00:05:09,820 --> 00:05:12,040
Let's greet him cheerfully! Okay!

92
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:14,180
Hello!

93
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:16,548
Everyone! Hello, bear!

94
00:05:16,598 --> 00:05:19,880
I'm Kumawari-kun, bear! Nice to meet you!

95
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,160
Yay!

96
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:23,120
Hey, hey, go for it!

97
00:05:23,860 --> 00:05:26,320
Wow! It's the real Kumawari-kun!

98
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:28,260
It's so fluffy!

99
00:05:28,660 --> 00:05:30,940
He's bigger than he looks on TV.

100
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:32,660
Let me touch him too!

101
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:36,200
Everyone's so energetic, that's great, bear!

102
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:37,980
What a pain.

103
00:05:37,980 --> 00:05:40,900
It's stifling hot,
and the kids are so annoying.

104
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:43,800
Hey, stop pulling!
Who was the one who just kicked me?

105
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,480
Idiot!

106
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:51,340
You're a mascot the children love now,
you know.

107
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:53,480
Don't go getting serious about it.

108
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,080
Hey.

109
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,760
Kumawari-kun, are you okay?

110
00:05:58,180 --> 00:06:01,630
Just kidding, kuma.
Kumawari-kun is super tough,

111
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,700
so he's fine no matter
what happens to him, kuma.

112
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:04,920
Wow!

113
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:09,180
Then let's study traffic
rules together, kuma.

114
00:06:09,420 --> 00:06:10,120
Yes!

115
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:11,600
He's really become popular, hasn't he.

116
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:15,500
Well, Ryo-chan himself is
basically a big kid to begin with.

117
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:16,720
That's true enough.

118
00:06:17,260 --> 00:06:18,121
Kumawari-kun,

119
00:06:18,171 --> 00:06:22,080
we brought a present for Kumawari-kun.
Right, everyone?

120
00:06:22,380 --> 00:06:22,660
Yeah!

121
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:24,720
Really, kuma? I'm happy, kuma.

122
00:06:25,860 --> 00:06:26,700
Cabbage?

123
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:30,940
Yes, it says right here that
his favorite food is cabbage.

124
00:06:30,940 --> 00:06:34,340
Takashi knows everything there is to know about Kumawari-kun,
you know.

125
00:06:34,340 --> 00:06:39,060
We all brought cabbage so he
could eat lots of his favorite food.

126
00:06:39,060 --> 00:06:39,960
Eat it.

127
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:41,760
I don't want anything.

128
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:46,260
So Kumawari-kun's favorite food is cabbage?

129
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:49,920
I think I just made up
that setting carelessly.

130
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,380
Don't make things up carelessly!

131
00:06:51,380 --> 00:06:54,020
Since it's come to this,
take responsibility and eat it all.

132
00:06:54,020 --> 00:06:56,500
That's unreasonable, so much of it!

133
00:06:56,500 --> 00:06:58,680
Are you trying to crush
the children's dreams?

134
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,360
Look at those kids' eyes.

135
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:03,020
They don't think there's a person inside.

136
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:06,480
They believe Kumawari-kun
is a real creature.

137
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:09,460
Are you going to betray such pure feelings?

138
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:10,120
But...

139
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,640
It's his favorite food, right?

140
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:13,580
Thank you, kuma.

141
00:07:14,140 --> 00:07:15,660
I'm so touched, kuma.

142
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:17,680
Itadakimasu.

143
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:20,680
You'll remember this, Bucha!

144
00:07:26,420 --> 00:07:29,060
Okay, the car has stopped,
so let's cross quickly, bear!

145
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:33,820
That's wrong! You have to check left and right
carefully and raise your hand before crossing.

146
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:36,700
But I've never seen anyone
actually cross like that.

147
00:07:37,860 --> 00:07:41,800
How many times do I have to tell you?
You're Kumawari-kun, the children's hero!

148
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,800
Understood.

149
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:47,240
Then let's cross together
with our hands raised, bear!

150
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:48,500
Yes!

151
00:07:49,740 --> 00:07:53,600
Whoa! Hey! Even with your hand up,
you have to stop, bear!

152
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:59,480
Like that, there are people in town who don't follow traffic rules,
so be very careful, bear!

153
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:00,520
Yes!

154
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:05,540
But Kumawari-kun is strong,
so he's stronger than a car, right!

155
00:08:07,100 --> 00:08:12,880
That's right! It says right here that Kumawari-kun
is strong enough to lift a truck with ease!

156
00:08:13,340 --> 00:08:15,620
No, no, that's just a setting!

157
00:08:16,740 --> 00:08:19,020
Wow! I want to see it, Reiko!

158
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:22,680
He could lift a car that
size with one hand, right?

159
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,620
Show them!

160
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:27,980
Kumawari-kun, show them.

161
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:32,280
You understand, Ryotsu. It's for the kids.

162
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:34,200
R-roger, bear.

163
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:39,420
W-why would you do something like this!

164
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:40,120
Where?!

165
00:08:40,780 --> 00:08:41,260
Where?!

166
00:08:41,300 --> 00:08:41,780
Where?!

167
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:43,620
Where?!

168
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:50,800
Beep beep!

169
00:08:55,420 --> 00:08:59,320
How about that, kuma?
Kumawari-kun is super strong, kuma!

170
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,840
Here's your reward.

171
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:04,460
Thanks.

172
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:06,820
Crack, crack, crack, crack!

173
00:09:06,820 --> 00:09:09,480
Okay, next I want to see the Kumawari Kick!

174
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:11,180
The Kumawari Kick?

175
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:15,120
It's Kumawari-kun's finishing move, isn't it?
It's written right here too.

176
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:18,300
The Kumawari Kick can knock
over even a beer, right?

177
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:19,640
I want to see that too.

178
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:20,320
Me too.

179
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,720
Knock over a beer too.

180
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:24,660
Kick, kick, kick!

181
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:27,940
A kick's fine. It's just pretending anyway.

182
00:09:27,940 --> 00:09:28,780
Kick, kick, kick!

183
00:09:28,780 --> 00:09:32,520
Roger, kuma!
Breaking concrete is my signature move!

184
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:34,740
I'll show you something special, kuma.

185
00:09:34,740 --> 00:09:36,020
Yay!

186
00:09:36,020 --> 00:09:37,960
Chana-sensei, over here! Over here!

187
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,040
Chana-sensei!

188
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,440
Chana-sensei!

189
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,780
Chana, Chana, Chana, Chana!

190
00:09:42,780 --> 00:09:44,260
Wh-who's there, kuma?

191
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:48,140
Apparently gymnastics teacher
Chana also does kickboxing.

192
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:52,020
Chana-sensei is ranked third in the world,
you know.

193
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:52,900
What?!

194
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:54,160
Nare-kē-kun!

195
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:55,020
No way, that's not happening!

196
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:56,300
Chana, Chana, Chana!

197
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,520
Nice to meet you, let's have a good match!

198
00:09:59,140 --> 00:10:01,560
Chana, Chana, Chana, Chana, Chana, Chana!

199
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:02,480
Yes, yes!

200
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:05,760
Are you kidding me! How am I
supposed to fight someone like that?!

201
00:10:07,380 --> 00:10:10,180
Don't run away, Ryotsu!
The kids are watching!

202
00:10:10,460 --> 00:10:13,320
Chief, that's unreasonable.
How could I possibly win?!

203
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,860
That's what a true hero is.

204
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:18,100
Go out there and fight hard.

205
00:10:18,100 --> 00:10:18,760
Chana!

206
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:24,900
Don't eat Kumawari-kun!

207
00:10:26,580 --> 00:10:28,900
The Kumawari Kids have been decided!

208
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,640
Well, let's get going.

209
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:33,600
Amazing, amazing!
Kumawari-kun really is strong after all!

210
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:36,060
Wonderful! Here's your reward, cabbage!

211
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:37,080
Thanks!

212
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:39,900
If it's tasty, then it's tasty!

213
00:10:40,340 --> 00:10:41,640
I've reached my limit!

214
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:43,840
Damn it, I'm taking this thing off!

215
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,220
What do you think you're doing?

216
00:10:46,220 --> 00:10:50,900
I've said it before, but don't
you dare ruin the children's dreams.

217
00:10:50,900 --> 00:10:51,720
Got it?

218
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,200
Understood, kuma.

219
00:10:53,660 --> 00:10:54,420
Count on you.

220
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:56,860
Damn, saying whatever they please!

221
00:10:57,540 --> 00:11:01,100
Hey, hey, miss,
isn't Tanuki-kun coming today?

222
00:11:01,100 --> 00:11:02,920
Tanuki-kun?

223
00:11:02,920 --> 00:11:04,260
Don't you know?

224
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:05,960
He's Kumawari-kun's subordinate.

225
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:10,400
He's always messing up and causing Kumawari-kun nothing but trouble,
you know.

226
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:11,680
What a klutz.

227
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:14,100
I want to meet Tanuki-kun too.

228
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,340
We wanna see him! We wanna see him!

229
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:17,920
Leave it to me, kuma.

230
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:20,520
Tanukkii-kun will be here soon, kuma.

231
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:21,440
Really?

232
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:23,480
It's true, kuma. We're waiting, kuma.

233
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:25,540
What could it be?

234
00:11:26,060 --> 00:11:26,700
Well...

235
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:27,960
Everyone,

236
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,120
It's Tanukkii!

237
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,540
Sorry to keep you waiting, kuma.

238
00:11:31,540 --> 00:11:34,380
My subordinate, always clumsy and useless.

239
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:36,100
It's Tanukkii, kuma.

240
00:11:36,100 --> 00:11:38,160
Ryo-san, you punk!

241
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:41,360
Hey, hey, Tanukkii-kun,
your voice is too small, kuma.

242
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:43,380
Then nobody can hear us, kuma.

243
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:49,000
Tanuki-kun! Is this really okay?
You'll break the children's dreams!

244
00:11:49,780 --> 00:11:53,360
Then everyone,
call out to Tanuki-kun loudly, kuma!

245
00:11:53,580 --> 00:11:57,580
I'm sure Tanuki-kun will
answer cheerfully, kuma!

246
00:11:57,940 --> 00:11:59,820
Come on! Ready, go!

247
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,860
Tanuki-kun!

248
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:05,440
Tamu! I'm so happy to
see everyone today, tamu!

249
00:12:05,620 --> 00:12:08,360
Let's study traffic
rules together too, tamu!

250
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:09,760
Yes!

251
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:11,680
Chief, in Katsushika Ward...

252
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:14,120
Ryo-chan always gets carried away.

253
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:17,100
Today was fun, bear!

254
00:12:17,100 --> 00:12:19,400
We'll come play again, Tam!

255
00:12:19,980 --> 00:12:21,340
Are you leaving already?

256
00:12:21,340 --> 00:12:22,900
We want to play more!

257
00:12:22,900 --> 00:12:24,820
Come on, please!

258
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:27,300
I'm sorry, but we also

259
00:12:27,300 --> 00:12:29,680
have to go back to our secret base, bear.

260
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:30,720
Secret base.

261
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:33,180
Sure, there's one somewhere in this town,

262
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:35,620
it says they live in a secret base.

263
00:12:35,620 --> 00:12:37,060
That's right, bear.

264
00:12:37,060 --> 00:12:38,980
Well then, everyone, see you later, bear!

265
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:41,420
Bye-bye, see you!

266
00:12:41,420 --> 00:12:42,080
Bye-bye!

267
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:43,960
Bye-bye!

268
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:45,460
Bye-bye!

269
00:12:49,340 --> 00:12:52,040
Chief, can I take this off now?

270
00:12:52,340 --> 00:12:56,160
Not yet. Not until we're farther
away from the kindergarten.

271
00:12:57,340 --> 00:12:58,780
Alright, that's far enough.

272
00:12:58,780 --> 00:12:59,780
Yes!

273
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:03,300
Finally, I can say goodbye
to this sweltering costume.

274
00:13:03,300 --> 00:13:04,640
The zipper's...

275
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,060
Is it stuck? Is it stuck?

276
00:13:07,460 --> 00:13:09,080
Finally, some relief.

277
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,440
Good work.

278
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:11,800
Thanks.

279
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:13,760
Phew, it was hot.

280
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:17,880
It's for the children. This can't be helped.

281
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:20,980
Look, Nakagawa, Reiko!
Help me out over here too!

282
00:13:20,980 --> 00:13:22,120
Excuse me.

283
00:13:23,060 --> 00:13:24,900
Ryo-chan, wait! Look!

284
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:27,520
We found Kumawari-kun!

285
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:30,340
He's not going to run away like this, is he?

286
00:13:30,340 --> 00:13:31,040
Damn it!

287
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:32,700
He ran away!

288
00:13:32,700 --> 00:13:33,460
Why?

289
00:13:33,460 --> 00:13:35,040
Damn it, why?

290
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:36,500
Let's keep playing!

291
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:37,940
Why are you running away?

292
00:13:37,940 --> 00:13:38,700
Wait!

293
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:40,740
Give me a break, kuma.

294
00:13:54,780 --> 00:13:56,300
We barely got away, didn't we?

295
00:13:57,040 --> 00:14:00,400
I can't take this heat anymore.
I'm taking this thing off right now!

296
00:14:01,820 --> 00:14:02,660
Got you!

297
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:05,580
I wonder if his secret base is around here.

298
00:14:05,580 --> 00:14:08,000
Hey, hey, let's keep playing together!

299
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,280
Kumawari-kun, come on!

300
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:10,320
Bear!

301
00:14:12,300 --> 00:14:15,480
You kids really like Kumawari-kun that much?

302
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:17,300
He's so cute,

303
00:14:17,300 --> 00:14:18,100
and he's cool,

304
00:14:18,100 --> 00:14:18,700
and he's strong.

305
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:19,560
He's a hero!

306
00:14:19,560 --> 00:14:21,920
I see, you like him that much?

307
00:14:22,300 --> 00:14:24,720
You kids really want to
play with me that badly?

308
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:25,340
Me?

309
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:28,400
So? Do you want to play or not? Which is it?

310
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:29,880
We want to play!

311
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:32,200
Then follow me, kuma!

312
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:32,880
Yay!

313
00:14:33,820 --> 00:14:36,500
My name is Kumawari-kun.

314
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:38,940
I'll protect this town for everyone, kuma.

315
00:14:38,940 --> 00:14:39,520
Kuma!

316
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:42,240
When you're in a bear-y bad spot,
Kumawari-kun!

317
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:42,480
Kuma!

318
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:45,580
Everyone's hero, Kumawari-kun!

319
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:45,900
Kuma!

320
00:14:49,660 --> 00:14:50,920
Watch closely, kuma!

321
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:53,020
Dolls like these that are hard to grab

322
00:14:53,020 --> 00:14:55,060
aim for the narrow part, kuma.

323
00:14:55,060 --> 00:14:57,860
Wow! You got four!

324
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,960
I-I've never seen anything like that!

325
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,560
Kumawari-kun is amazing!

326
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:03,940
Piece of cake!

327
00:15:04,260 --> 00:15:07,020
But I didn't expect Kumawari-kun
to be good at crane games.

328
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:13,700
This is my true self, kuma! Today I'll show
it to you special kids, just for you, kuma!

329
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,060
No!

330
00:15:15,340 --> 00:15:19,900
This place's taiyaki has more bean paste than other shops, kuma!
Remember that, kuma!

331
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:20,900
Yes!

332
00:15:21,540 --> 00:15:23,900
My name is Kumawari-kun!

333
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:24,280
Kuma!

334
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:27,060
I'll protect this town for everyone, kuma!

335
00:15:27,300 --> 00:15:27,540
Kuma!

336
00:15:27,860 --> 00:15:30,780
Kumawari-kun, everyone's hero!

337
00:15:30,940 --> 00:15:31,060
Kuma!

338
00:15:31,820 --> 00:15:33,540
Hey, how've you been, kuma!

339
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:36,600
Well, I, what, what is it!

340
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:44,440
Well then, I'm the one-day idol of Kumari-gumi, kuma!
Ryo-san? I'm Kumari-gumi now!

341
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:52,920
I don't know any such guy, got it? Okay, everyone, kuma,
this uncle will give you all whatever you like, kuma!

342
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:53,060
Kumaaa!

343
00:15:54,260 --> 00:15:54,940
Yay!

344
00:15:55,160 --> 00:15:56,740
What are you saying, Ryo-san!

345
00:15:56,940 --> 00:15:58,000
It's Kumawari-kun!

346
00:15:58,220 --> 00:16:00,060
Charge the big spending
to the Katsushika station!

347
00:16:00,140 --> 00:16:01,100
Got it?!

348
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:02,620
O-okay...

349
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:06,580
The contrast between the smiling costume
and that menacing voice is scary...

350
00:16:07,060 --> 00:16:09,640
My name is Kumawari-kun!

351
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:09,960
Kumaa!

352
00:16:10,060 --> 00:16:12,620
I'll protect this town for everyone, kumaa!

353
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:13,120
Kumaa!

354
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:16,120
You idiot!

355
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:18,100
What the hell do you think you're doing,
you bastard!

356
00:16:18,280 --> 00:16:19,560
S-sorry...

357
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:21,120
Hey, what the hell are you doing picking on kids,
you bastard!

358
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,860
My name is Kumawari-kun.

359
00:16:24,860 --> 00:16:26,080
What do you mean, Kumawari-kun?

360
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:29,480
Damn it, I'm really angry now!

361
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:33,060
Have you had enough?

362
00:16:33,060 --> 00:16:34,240
I give up.

363
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,640
Yay!

364
00:16:36,160 --> 00:16:37,560
That's so cool!

365
00:16:37,560 --> 00:16:40,300
Kumawari-kun really is our hero, after all!

366
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:44,500
My name is Kumawari-kun.

367
00:16:44,500 --> 00:16:47,580
The bear who protects
this town for everyone.

368
00:16:47,580 --> 00:16:49,220
The bear who protects.

369
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:51,800
Bye-bye, Kumawari-kun!

370
00:16:53,300 --> 00:16:54,360
Bye-bye, bear!

371
00:16:57,220 --> 00:16:58,720
Man, I'm beat.

372
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,240
In the end, all day long.

373
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:02,340
Kumawari-kun really made me cry, you know.

374
00:17:02,340 --> 00:17:03,560
Senpaaai!

375
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:05,820
I washed the Kumawari-kun costume.

376
00:17:05,820 --> 00:17:07,540
Sorry, hang it up to dry for me.

377
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:08,240
Understood.

378
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,600
That must have been tough.

379
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:16,080
Wearing this all day long...

380
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:17,360
But...

381
00:17:19,020 --> 00:17:20,140
Well, it's fine.

382
00:17:20,140 --> 00:17:22,140
Dressing up like that once
in a while isn't so bad.

383
00:17:28,420 --> 00:17:29,620
Morning already?

384
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:32,620
Guess I'll sleep a little longer.

385
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:34,700
What?

386
00:17:34,700 --> 00:17:37,640
Kumawari-kun's... Kumawari-kun's...

387
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,480
No, don't die!

388
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:41,020
Oh no.

389
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:43,860
Kumawari-kun...

390
00:17:43,860 --> 00:17:44,820
He's dead!

391
00:17:44,820 --> 00:17:46,440
Senpai, what should we do?

392
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:48,900
They think Kumawari-kun is dead.

393
00:17:48,900 --> 00:17:51,580
Anyway,
we have to retrieve it and cover this up.

394
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:54,860
Oh no!

395
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:56,300
Damn it! Hold on!

396
00:17:56,420 --> 00:17:56,800
Okay!

397
00:17:57,380 --> 00:17:59,240
Not again!

398
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,160
It's falling!

399
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:02,600
Whoa!

400
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:04,420
Come on!

401
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:07,160
He got run over!

402
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:10,820
Kumawari-kun's gone and died!

403
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:13,620
Now it's complicated again.

404
00:18:14,860 --> 00:18:16,580
He got blown away again!

405
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:17,260
You guys!

406
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:19,120
Wait!

407
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:21,120
Not again!

408
00:18:22,780 --> 00:18:24,440
Where could he have gone?

409
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:26,520
I'm sure he came this way.

410
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:30,760
What happened?

411
00:18:30,760 --> 00:18:31,940
Kumawari-kun...

412
00:18:31,940 --> 00:18:33,720
Shit!

413
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:34,740
Senpai

414
00:18:36,340 --> 00:18:37,160
Hold onto this.

415
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:37,400
Yes.

416
00:18:38,100 --> 00:18:39,260
I went and worried about it.

417
00:18:39,820 --> 00:18:41,620
Honda, look after the kids!

418
00:18:41,620 --> 00:18:43,040
Please be careful.

419
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:43,700
Well, that's...

420
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:46,560
Senpai...

421
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:48,420
Kumawari-kun...

422
00:18:48,420 --> 00:18:49,380
Don't go!

423
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,100
Kumawari-kun

424
00:18:54,380 --> 00:18:55,260
He's back, kuma!

425
00:18:55,260 --> 00:18:57,120
Kumawari-kun

426
00:18:57,120 --> 00:18:57,960
So he's still alive!

427
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:58,440
Amazing!

428
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:00,540
As expected of you, senpai!

429
00:19:00,540 --> 00:19:01,780
Idiot!

430
00:19:01,780 --> 00:19:05,860
Ever since this morning, we've been flooded with
calls about Kumawari-kun being in serious trouble!

431
00:19:05,860 --> 00:19:07,600
What on earth were you doing?

432
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:09,640
I was only chasing the costume -

433
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,780
It's your fault for poor management,
isn't it!

434
00:19:11,780 --> 00:19:15,700
The station chief says that if this goes on,
Katsushika Station's image will be ruined!

435
00:19:15,700 --> 00:19:17,000
What do you intend to do?

436
00:19:17,520 --> 00:19:21,360
What do you mean,
"do"? It's not my fault the wind blew it away!

437
00:19:22,340 --> 00:19:25,520
Listen, no matter what,
go improve Kumawari-kun's image.

438
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:28,440
If you fail, it'll be more than
just your manuscript, got it?

439
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:30,100
What a troublesome bear.

440
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:33,680
Hey, how did it come to this?

441
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:37,880
If we could improve the image that easily,
we wouldn't have any trouble, would we?

442
00:19:37,880 --> 00:19:40,440
That Chief,
always saying whatever he pleases!

443
00:19:40,880 --> 00:19:41,720
It's Kumawari-kun.

444
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:43,480
What are you doing?

445
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:45,100
Let's play together!

446
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:48,500
Bad bear, I'm not in the
mood for that right now, bear.

447
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:50,800
Hey, you don't seem so cheerful.
What's wrong?

448
00:19:53,340 --> 00:19:55,620
So you messed up

449
00:19:55,620 --> 00:19:59,200
Even the always-perfect Kumawari-kun
makes mistakes once in a while.

450
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:02,220
Cheer up, Kumawari-kun. Poor thing.

451
00:20:03,020 --> 00:20:03,940
Thanks, kuma.

452
00:20:04,660 --> 00:20:06,520
But we can't keep going like this, can we?

453
00:20:06,520 --> 00:20:08,700
We have to somehow improve his image.

454
00:20:08,700 --> 00:20:09,680
What should we do?

455
00:20:10,360 --> 00:20:13,280
For example,
having people see him working harder.

456
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:17,540
If he helps everyone,
his popularity might go up.

457
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:22,220
That's it! If Kumawari-kun catches a criminal,
everyone will be amazed.

458
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:26,700
You mean he'd earn a commendation, kuma?
But it won't go that smoothly, kuma.

459
00:20:27,700 --> 00:20:30,120
You won't know unless you try, will you?

460
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:32,080
Good luck, Kumawari-kun!

461
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:32,920
Beat 'em!

462
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:33,700
Beat 'em!

463
00:20:34,380 --> 00:20:38,200
Even if you say that,
criminals don't just show up that easily,

464
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:38,780
Thief!

465
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:41,780
Yeah, just like this, a thief suddenly

466
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:46,400
Isn't that a thief?

467
00:20:47,540 --> 00:20:48,240
Feels like it's going to happen.

468
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:50,440
It's your chance! Kumawari-kun!

469
00:20:51,060 --> 00:20:51,820
Go for it!

470
00:20:52,660 --> 00:20:55,000
Leave it to me! Watch this, you guys!

471
00:20:55,520 --> 00:20:58,380
I'll show you the true
power of Kumawari-kun!

472
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:02,000
Kumawari-kun!

473
00:21:06,220 --> 00:21:07,860
Hey! I won't let you escape! Bear!

474
00:21:08,100 --> 00:21:08,780
What the hell!

475
00:21:12,880 --> 00:21:14,400
W-what does a bear want with me?

476
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:18,200
I'm not just any bear!
I'm the Bear Officer! I'm Kumawari-kun!

477
00:21:18,900 --> 00:21:19,820
Oh shit!

478
00:21:20,840 --> 00:21:22,100
Bear, you're under arrest!

479
00:21:24,580 --> 00:21:25,360
It's... it's too cramped!

480
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:27,540
Damn it, wait! Bear!

481
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:31,700
Shit, this guy,
what the hell is this bastard!

482
00:21:31,900 --> 00:21:32,840
Hahaha, serves you right!

483
00:21:33,340 --> 00:21:36,480
Don't you mock me,
I'll catch you no matter what! Bear!

484
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:37,200
What?!

485
00:21:40,020 --> 00:21:41,660
Damn it! Dammit!

486
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:48,900
Got it! Found you, bear!

487
00:21:49,060 --> 00:21:49,560
Shit!

488
00:21:51,180 --> 00:21:52,320
Arrest, bear!

489
00:21:52,700 --> 00:21:54,980
I've been beaten! Kuma-rizen!

490
00:21:55,560 --> 00:21:56,720
Wait, bear!

491
00:22:07,460 --> 00:22:09,160
Looks like he got away.

492
00:22:09,580 --> 00:22:10,560
That was close, that was close.

493
00:22:11,300 --> 00:22:14,820
Still, what was that bear-like thing?

494
00:22:19,660 --> 00:22:21,240
W-what was that voice?

495
00:22:21,240 --> 00:22:23,720
I'm sure it came this way.

496
00:22:24,240 --> 00:22:25,240
Look.

497
00:22:26,220 --> 00:22:27,800
This is Kumawari-kun's

498
00:22:30,500 --> 00:22:32,640
Wow, it's Kumawari-kun!

499
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:36,500
We did it, kuma!

500
00:22:38,560 --> 00:22:41,780
I'm scared, this isn't Kumawari-kun at all!

501
00:22:41,780 --> 00:22:43,040
Mommy

502
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:47,000
Why's he a bear...

503
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:50,960
Bakabon! What is this photo?!

504
00:22:51,680 --> 00:22:55,960
I-it couldn't be helped!
I was so absorbed in catching the criminal!

505
00:22:56,360 --> 00:22:58,840
Even so,
letting them take a photo like this!

506
00:22:59,020 --> 00:23:02,260
This, this photo is terrible.

507
00:23:02,260 --> 00:23:04,500
No wonder the kids burst into tears.

508
00:23:04,500 --> 00:23:06,180
Hey, hey, Kumawari-san!

509
00:23:07,440 --> 00:23:08,580
Where's Kumawari-kun?

510
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:10,820
Y-you guys!

511
00:23:11,240 --> 00:23:12,240
Ta-da!

512
00:23:12,340 --> 00:23:13,520
How cute!

513
00:23:13,760 --> 00:23:14,740
You guys!

514
00:23:15,420 --> 00:23:17,340
It's the Kumawari-kun costume set!

515
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:19,900
From today, we're Kumawari-kun too!

516
00:23:19,900 --> 00:23:22,300
We were a little scared the other day, but

517
00:23:22,820 --> 00:23:26,140
Kumawari-kun is our hero!

518
00:23:26,140 --> 00:23:28,180
You guys

519
00:23:28,860 --> 00:23:29,620
See you

520
00:23:29,620 --> 00:23:30,800
Bye-bye

521
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,220
What's going on?

522
00:23:33,220 --> 00:23:36,420
Chief, we're heading out on patrol.

523
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:38,360
Wait, bear!

524
00:23:38,360 --> 00:23:40,400
Let's play together today too, bear!

525
00:23:41,100 --> 00:23:41,980
Bye-bye

526
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:50,680
Suigyo, jugemu jugemu

527
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:52,940
Gokō no surikire, kaijari suigyo

528
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:03,460
Sandals anytime, scandals anytime

529
00:24:03,460 --> 00:24:04,540
Never you mind

530
00:24:05,400 --> 00:24:07,120
Playing it cool

531
00:24:07,120 --> 00:24:08,340
Every day

532
00:24:08,340 --> 00:24:12,740
Boredom crumpled up into a reprimand

533
00:24:12,740 --> 00:24:13,880
tossed away

534
00:24:15,040 --> 00:24:16,240
Naked instinct

535
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:18,420
Going wild and foolish

536
00:24:19,220 --> 00:24:21,160
Reckless and broke

537
00:24:21,540 --> 00:24:22,220
Isn't that great?

538
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:25,680
My way,

539
00:24:25,680 --> 00:24:26,580
however I want,

540
00:24:26,580 --> 00:24:28,000
that's all there is to it.

541
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:30,780
The stubborn Chief's thunderbolt,

542
00:24:30,780 --> 00:24:32,540
smoke pouring from the head.

543
00:24:33,280 --> 00:24:36,040
Run away and you're a tortoise climbing.

544
00:24:36,040 --> 00:24:37,300
Well, isn't that wonderful.

545
00:24:38,020 --> 00:24:39,780
In flowery Edo,

546
00:24:39,780 --> 00:24:41,820
mass-produced typhoons.

547
00:24:41,820 --> 00:24:42,780
Thanks as always!

548
00:24:42,780 --> 00:24:45,340
Raging wild.

549
00:24:45,340 --> 00:24:47,260
Atarakamon ne, kyūbaito.

550
00:24:47,260 --> 00:24:51,240
Jugemu jugemu,
kokono mizukire, kaitari suigyo.

551
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:56,320
Suigyo-batsu gun, gyo-batsu gū,
raibatsu gū, neru tokoro ni suku tokoro.

552
00:24:56,900 --> 00:25:01,060
Yamura Kōji, Burakōji,
Paipo paipo paipo no Shūringan

553
00:25:01,060 --> 00:25:06,200
Shūringan no Kūrindaiku,
Kūrindai no Poppo Kokkī no Poppo Konādo

554
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:08,180
Chō-kyūmei no Jōsukē-i!

555
00:25:15,340 --> 00:25:20,240
I finally understand now!
What I need most is Maria! It's you!

556
00:25:20,380 --> 00:25:23,400
You taught me so many important things!

557
00:25:23,940 --> 00:25:27,900
One last question!
Who on earth are those weirdos?

558
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:32,220
Next time, Love Warrior Kankichi Ryotsu!
See you then!

559
00:25:33,760 --> 00:25:36,200
Kameari is right over there!

560
00:25:36,960 --> 00:25:39,500
Well, surely Kameari is there!

561
00:25:40,620 --> 00:25:44,140
Everybody come on over, to our town!

562
00:25:45,340 --> 00:25:45,900
Thank you!

